<h2>Overdue Task Alert </h2>

<p>Hello <%= @user.username %>,</p>

<p>The following task is overdue:</p>

<p>
  <strong>Title:</strong> <%= @task.title %><br>
  <strong>Description:</strong> <%= @task.description %><br>
  <strong>Deadline:</strong> <%= @task.estimated_deadline %>
</p>

<p>Make sure to complete the task or update the status of the task.</p>

<p> <strong> Regards ProjectHUb </strong> </p>